    <h1 class="legal-h1">How we process data for you.</h1>
    <p class="legal-lede">Short version: what your workspace holds — the brief, the notes, the drafts, a member's imported network, the Slack channels you connect — is yours. You decide what goes in and what it's for; we process it on your instructions and for nobody else. This is the data processing addendum that says so, and it's part of the <a href="/terms/">terms</a>.</p>
