      <div>
        <h2>The paperwork</h2>
        <p><strong>The parties:</strong> you — the company paying for the workspace, through whoever accepted the terms for it — and us, ND Management Holding B.V., trading as Prospektor. <em>Our registered address, Chamber of Commerce number and VAT number will be added here; until then <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a> reaches the people who answer for this page.</em></p>
        <p><strong>Precedence:</strong> this page is part of the <a href="/terms/">terms</a>. Where the two disagree about personal data, this page wins. The privacy page describes; this page binds.</p>
        <p><strong>Liability</strong> under this page is the terms' liability, capped and excluded the same way, in both directions.</p>
        <p><strong>Signing:</strong> nothing to sign — accepting the terms accepts this. If your procurement needs a countersigned copy, email us and we'll sign this text as it stands.</p>
        <p>None of this is legal advice to you. It's what we do, written down so you can hold us to it.</p>
